    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "What particular anxiety spoils the country dweller's visit to the theatre?",
      "translation": "什么样的特别焦虑破坏了乡村居民去剧院观看演出的心情？",
      "startTime": 10.97,
      "endTime": 17.93,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "anxiety",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "焦虑"
          },
          {
